----------------------------------------------------------------
------ filters
----------------------------------------------------------------

index=abc*abc* logtype=abc AND some_attr="abc" AND NOT some_attr='abc' AND some_attr>=400
| search some_attr='asd' OR some_attr='fgh'
| where isnotnull(some_attr)
| where some_attr like "DK%" 
| where some_attr != "abc"
| where some_attr IN ("asd", "asd2")

----------------------------------------------------------------
------ new attributes
----------------------------------------------------------------

| eval some_attr = case(some_attr_1=="a", "1", some_attr_1=="qqq", "2", 1==1, "3") ```  1==1 - default value  ```
| iplocation ip_address  ```  adds new attributes. f.ex. "Country" ```
| eval some_attr = coalesce(some_attr_1, some_attr_2)

```  strings  ```
| eval some_attr = replace(some_attr_1,"\'","")
| eval some_attr = substr(some_attr_1,4,4)
| eval some_attr = rtrim(some_attr_1, ".zip")

```  date and time ```
| eval date_day     = strftime(_time, "%Y-%m-%d")
| eval date_day_utc = strftime(_time-3600, "%Y-%m-%d")
| eval yesterday 	= strftime(relative_time(time(), "-d"), "%Y-%m-%d")
| eval some_date	= strftime(relative_time(time(), "-d"), "%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S.%N") ``` -1 day (24h) ```
| eval today 		= strftime(relative_time(time(), "@d"), "%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S.%N") ``` start of the day ```
| eval some_date	= strftime(relative_time(time(), "-25h"), "%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S.%N") ``` -25h ```
| eval some_date	= strftime(relative_time(time(), "+h"), "%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S.%N") ``` +1h ```

| eval time_hour 	= strftime(_time,"%Y-%m-%d %H:00:00")
| eval time_day  	= strftime(_time,"%Y-%m-%d 00:00:00")
| eval time 	 	= strftime(_time,"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S.%N")  
| eval new_time 	= strftime(_time + 7200, "%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S.%QZ")

```  agg  ```
| stats count 				as some_attr1, 
        sum(some_attr) 		as some_attr2, 
		avg(some_attr) 		as some_attr3,
        stdev(some_attr) 	as some_attr4,
		distinct_count(some_attr) 
    by some_attr7, some_attr8
| stats values(*) as * by some_attr  ```  put all values to one value for all attributes grouped by some_attr  ```

		
```  numbers  ```
| eval some_attr = round(some_attr1/some_attr2*100,2)

```  regexp  ```
| rex "SomeText=\'(?<new_attr_name>.*?)\' MoreText="

```  other  ```
| rename some_attr1 AS some_attr2
| rename some_attr_group.* as *
| fillnull value='unknown' some_attr 

```  select and output ```
| table some_attr1, some_attr2
| sort -some_attr1
| sort some_attr2 desc
| uniq
| head 100

| append [ search ... ] ``` ~ SQL "union"  ```


```  files  ```
| lookup some_file.csv some_attr1, some_attr2 ```  1 or more attributes with the same name (splunk and files)  ```
| inputlookup some_file.csv ```  Check for null values in a lookup table (otherwise it will be filtered out)  ```


```  arrays  ```
| makemv delim="|" new_field ```  Converts a single valued field into a multivalue field   ```
| eval new_field_split_count = mvcount(new_field) 

| eval some_attr  = split(some_attr2,"\\") 
| eval some_attr3 = mvindex(some_attr,5)

| eval some_attr_string = mvjoin(some_attr, ", ")

```  visual  ```
| bucket span=4hr _time
| bin _time span=30m 
| timechart count span=1m by some_attr limit=5 useother=f
| predict count future_timespan=60

```  IP ADDRESS  ```
index=index_name
| iplocation ip_address_attr
| rename Country AS IP_country

----------------------------------------------------------------
------ all indexes
----------------------------------------------------------------
| eventcount summarize=false index=* | dedup index | fields index

