------ other
----------------------------------------------------------------
comments - ```    ```
```

<option name="charting.seriesColors">
        [0x006d9c, 0x4fa484, 0xec9960, 0xaf575a]
        </option>
red 0xd6563c -- af575a
blue 0x3863a0 -- 006d9c
orange 0xffb380 -- ec9960
green 0x00b290 or 0x3d9988 -- 4fa484

----------------------------------------------------------------
------ some notes
----------------------------------------------------------------
search 
	not necessary for the first row
	AND, OR, NOT- capital letters
	space is equal to AND
	it's possible to use brackets to set ups the right order
	it's possible to use * instead of real values. For example "*@gmail.com" - this statement will return all the emails with "@gmail.com" domain.
